<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Scope</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">This<sp/>chapter<sp/>explains<sp/>`NativeSolverAdapter`<sp/>and<sp/>baseline<sp/>built-in<sp/>solver<sp/>behavior.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Focus<sp/>first<sp/>on<sp/>correctness,<sp/>then<sp/>sophistication.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Brute-force<sp/>and<sp/>DPLL<sp/>are<sp/>useful<sp/>reference<sp/>points<sp/>before<sp/>CDCL<sp/>optimization.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```text</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">class<sp/>NativeSolverAdapter<sp/>:<sp/>public<sp/>sattyre::SATSolver<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">public:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>void<sp/>load(const<sp/>sattyre::SATProblem&amp;<sp/>problem)<sp/>override;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>sattyre::SolveResult<sp/>solve()<sp/>override;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>sattyre::SATModel<sp/>model()<sp/>const<sp/>override;</highlight></codeline>
